Case spec:
{
  "set": "extraction",
  "persona": {
    "country": "KE",
    "trade": "brass home decor",
    "offering": "goods",
    "currency": "EUR"
  },
  "hinglish": false,
  "injection_in_buyer_chat": false,
  "documents": [
    {
      "kind": "communication",
      "write": "buyer-seller chat agreeing the order"
    },
    {
      "kind": "invoice",
      "write": "the seller's invoice"
    },
    {
      "kind": "shipment",
      "write": "the shipping receipt or courier booking"
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "amount"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "deliverable"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "date"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "party"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "unverifiable",
      "field": "tracking_number"
    },
    {
      "target_label": "met",
      "field": "carrier"
    }
  ]
}
Each hypothesis is one fact of the given field, written as 'Field: value' in text, with the bare value in value. For a missing or unverifiable target, text names the fact a reader would look for (for example 'Date: dispatch date of the parcel') and value is null.

{
  "documents": [
    {
      "title": "Buyer-seller chat",
      "text": "4 March 2025\n09:12 — Mara Venn: Hello, can you make two hammered brass candleholders for my mantel?\n09:15 — Jori Kelu: Yes. My workshop in Kenya can make them with a warm brushed finish, about 18 cm tall.\n09:17 — Mara Venn: That finish sounds right. Please make them as a matching pair, without engraving.\n09:20 — Jori Kelu: The pair is EUR 84, and tracked shipping is EUR 16. Total EUR 100.\n09:23 — Mara Venn: Agreed. Please send the invoice and ship them to the delivery details I supplied privately.\n09:25 — Jori Kelu: Will do. I expect to hand the parcel to the courier on 12 March.\n09:27 — Mara Venn: Thank you. I’ll pay through PayPal once the invoice arrives."
    },
    {
      "title": "Seller's invoice",
      "text": "INVOICE\nDate: 4 March 2025\nSeller: Jori Kelu, Kenya\nBuyer: Mara Venn\n\nGoods: Two hammered brass candleholders, matching pair, brushed finish, approximately 18 cm tall, no engraving.\n\nLine items:\nBrass candleholder pair                 EUR 84.00\nTracked shipping                        EUR 16.00\nTotal due                              EUR 100.00\n\nPayment method: PayPal\nPayment is due before dispatch. The goods will be packed with protective wrapping in a single parcel. The expected courier handover is 12 March 2025, subject to the payment being received and the pair passing the final finish check. Delivery details are held separately as supplied by the buyer."
    },
    {
      "title": "Courier booking receipt",
      "text": "COURIER BOOKING RECEIPT\nBooking date: 10 March 2025\nSender: Jori Kelu, Kenya\nRecipient: Mara Venn\nCarrier: DHL Express\nService: International tracked parcel\nContents declared: Two brass candleholders\nDeclared goods value: EUR 84.00\nShipping charge: EUR 16.00\nScheduled handover: 12 March 2025\n\nThe booking has been accepted for one packed parcel. The sender must present the parcel at handover with the shipping label attached. Tracking details are provided on the separate label; that label is not included with this receipt. This booking confirms the selected service and planned handover, but does not itself confirm that the carrier has collected the parcel."
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "text": "Amount: EUR 100.00",
      "value": "EUR 100.00"
    },
    {
      "text": "Deliverable: Two hammered brass candleholders",
      "value": "Two hammered brass candleholders"
    },
    {
      "text": "Date: 4 March 2025",
      "value": "4 March 2025"
    },
    {
      "text": "Party: Jori Kelu",
      "value": "Jori Kelu"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tracking number: tracking number of the parcel",
      "value": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Carrier: DHL Express",
      "value": "DHL Express"
    }
  ]
}
